msgstr "这是什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Not for me."
msgstr "不适合我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "To cut the immortality."
msgstr "欲斩不朽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Which lady's surfboard is this?"
msgstr "这是哪位女士的冲浪板？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "What a nice mask!."
msgstr "多好的面具啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "..?"
msgstr "..？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "It'll be good for when winter comes."
msgstr "冬天来的时候用得上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Where is my dreadnought?"
msgstr "我的无畏舰在哪里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "What a beautyful sword."
msgstr "多么美丽的剑啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Is this useful?"
msgstr "这有用吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "What a beautyful sword."
msgstr "多么美丽的剑啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "It's beautiful."
msgstr "很美丽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "On its blade, there is no sharpness or killing intent."
msgstr "它的刀刃上，没有任何锋利和杀意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Demonic spirit?"
msgstr "魔灵？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "What a weird sword."
msgstr "多么奇怪的剑啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "What a beautyful sword."
msgstr "多么美丽的剑啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "This sword look dangerous,Don't touch it."
msgstr "这把剑看起来很危险，不要碰它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "What a beautyful sword."
msgstr "多么美丽的剑啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Tools from another world."
msgstr "来自另一个世界的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "This spear look different."
msgstr "这把矛看起来不一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "I'm fairly sure the bird host was around here a moment ago."
msgstr "我记得那位鸟主持人刚才还在这附近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "Drat, I thought for sure there'd be something good inside!"
msgstr "糟糕，我以为里面肯定有好东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "Excuse me. I will wait for your response."
msgstr "打扰了。我等您回复。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It would be too easy, perhaps if there were more of these little guys..."
msgstr "这太简单了，要是小家伙们再多一些就好了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "There aren't a lot of places around for them to hide."
msgstr "周围没有太多地方可以让他们藏身。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "I think that's enough for one day."
msgstr "我想今天玩得够多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "Aww. I want in there."
msgstr "唉，我想进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "I think it suits me a little better, if I'm honest."
msgstr "老实说，我觉得这件更适合我一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "Ah, they've all gone home. I'm a little late."
msgstr "啊，大家都回去了。我来晚了一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
msgid "Looks like it won't listen to me, I'm not its owner"
msgstr "看来它不听我的，我不是它的主人"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
msgid "I suppose I should bring a pillow first."
msgstr "看来我得先带个枕头来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "Could you spare a moment? I'd like you to see this."
msgstr "能占用您一点时间吗？想请您看看这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I'm not well enough for that. Perhaps after some rest."
msgstr "我现在身体还不行，等休息一下再说吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "Someone has already been here. A shame, it looked fun."
msgstr "已经有人来过了。真可惜，看起来挺好玩的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "The glass is in the way. That won't work."
msgstr "有玻璃挡着，这样行不通。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I already have one. Two would be a bit much."
msgstr "我已经有一只了。两只就有点多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I can't build this from up here. I'd best get down first."
msgstr "在上面没法建造，我还是先下来吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON"
msgid "Wait... no no!"
msgstr "等等……不不！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE"
msgid "I wasn't slow. It was simply too quick."
msgstr "不是我慢，是它太快了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "Changing near open flame is unsafe. Let's move first."
msgstr "靠近明火换衣服不安全。先换个地方吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "That seems like a lot of trouble just now."
msgstr "现在弄这个，好像有点太费事了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "Stop hogging it, I want to dress up too!"
msgstr "别一直占着，我也想打扮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "I suspect I need a beefalo here first."
msgstr "我想这里得先有头皮弗娄牛才行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "It would help if my beefalo had a little more hair."
msgstr "要是我的牛毛再多一点就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "It's too small to be worth weighing."
msgstr "太小了，不值得称。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "Too small to be worth the trouble."
msgstr "太小了，不值得费这个事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I should gather something to build with first."
msgstr "我应该先去收集些建造材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "Someone is using it. I'll wait my turn."
msgstr "有人在用。我等着轮到我吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "These are the wrong plans. Let me check again."
msgstr "这张图纸不对，让我再看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "It doesn't fit in there."
msgstr "这个放不进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY"
msgid "The ground is shaking. I can't concentrate right now."
msgstr "地面在晃，我现在静不下心来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Cooking isn't really my strength."
msgstr "做饭并不是我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "That smells wonderful. Would you mind sharing some?"
msgstr "闻起来真香。能分我一点吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "It's rather far. I'll have to walk over."
msgstr "有点远，得走过去才行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "I'd rather not interrupt it while it's cooking."
msgstr "还在煮，我不想打断它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "It's in use. I'll wait."
msgstr "正在使用中。我等一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "There's still something inside."
msgstr "里面还有东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "What should I draw, though?"
msgstr "不过，该画些什么好呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "A little seawater might toughen them up. Perhaps."
msgstr "一点海水也许能让它们更坚强。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "The fish are too deep. They're being rather clever."
msgstr "鱼都在深处，它们还挺聪明的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "Please come back. Take your time, but do come back."
msgstr "请回来吧。慢慢来也没关系，但一定要回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "It's busy at the moment."
msgstr "它现在正忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It's not working."
msgstr "它不起作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "Whenever you're ready. Though sooner would be nice."
msgstr "您准备好了就开始吧。不过能快点就更好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "I don't think that will work."
msgstr "我觉得这个不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "I don't think they can enjoy my gift now."
msgstr "我想他们现在没办法收下我的礼物了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We already know that one."
msgstr "这个我们已经知道了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "I'll wait for it to finish the first one."
msgstr "我等它吃完第一份吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "No, that won't do."
msgstr "不，这个不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "I'd rather not spend this on them."
msgstr "我不太想把这个用在他们身上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "It doesn't want that. It needs a living log."
msgstr "它不要这个，它需要一根活木。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "It doesn't want that. It needs a mushroom."
msgstr "它不要这个，它需要一朵蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "These mushrooms will not grow under this moon condition."
msgstr "这些蘑菇在这种月相下长不出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "It won't work in here!"
msgstr "在这里不行！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "Oh, don't stare at me!"
msgstr "哦，别盯着我看！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY"
msgid "This doesn't fit the lock."
msgstr "这和锁孔对不上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "I couldn't serve that to a guest. Or a dog."
msgstr "这种东西可不能端给客人。给狗也不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "I can cram it in there but I do not know if I could get it back out."
msgstr "我是能塞进去，但不知道还能不能拿出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I'd love to see someone sculpt with that."
msgstr "我倒想看看有谁能拿这个来雕刻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
