msgstr "柔软而有弹性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
