msgstr "一个疯狂的小坚果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "At least he's quiet now."
msgstr "至少他现在很安静。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "A very comfortable prison for a bird."
msgstr "这是鸟儿的舒适牢房。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "What's all the fuss about?"
msgstr "有什么大惊小怪的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "I've got you now."
msgstr "这下抓到你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "That should probably be cleaned up."
msgstr "这或许应该被清理掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
