msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "So shiny!"
msgstr "太闪亮了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "We could be good friends, you and I."
msgstr "我们可以成为好朋友，你和我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "I should chop that before it reaches full ugliness."
msgstr "我应该在它变得彻底难看之前把它砍掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Too many eyes. Far too many eyes."
msgstr "眼睛太多了。实在太多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "How am I supposed to see in that thing?"
msgstr "戴着这东西我要怎么看路？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "Can we clear this safely now?"
msgstr "现在可以安全清理这个了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "I suppose I can fix it. Hold on."
msgstr "我想我能修好它。等一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "I like the way it glitters."
msgstr "我喜欢它闪闪发光的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "Is that supposed to be here?"
msgstr "那东西本来就该在这里吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "That thing is creepy."
msgstr "那东西真让人毛骨悚然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "It looks like it wants a taste of something."
msgstr "它看起来好像想尝尝什么东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "That little fire doesn't even feel warm."
msgstr "那小小的火连一点暖意都没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "Right. Now I suppose I have to build it."
msgstr "好吧。现在我想我得把它建起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "It's dripping sleepy goo everywhere."
msgstr "它到处滴着让人犯困的黏液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "What a colorful plant."
msgstr "多么色彩缤纷的植物啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "It's so meaty. Unsettling."
msgstr "肉乎乎的。让人不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "It actually looks pretty tasty."
msgstr "其实看起来很好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "Wow. Look at it bubble."
msgstr "哇。看它冒泡泡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "What's in it? Do you have anything delicious?"
msgstr "里面有什么？你有什么好吃的吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "嗯..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "Nice bird... good bird..."
msgstr "好鸟……乖鸟……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "Unpleasant."
msgstr "真难闻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "Ha. A featherweight after all."
msgstr "哈。结果还是个轻量级。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "That took a great deal of effort."
msgstr "这可费了好大的功夫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He looks scared half to death."
msgstr "他看起来吓得半死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Why did this plant have a face?"
msgstr "这植物为什么长着一张脸？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "The face won't wash away."
msgstr "那张脸洗不掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "That's rather creepy."
msgstr "真让人毛骨悚然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "The meeping had to stop."
msgstr "那叫声总算停了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "That's not a normal plant."
msgstr "那不是普通的植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "The rabbits lost that argument."
msgstr "兔子们吵输了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "Nothing's on it?"
msgstr "上面什么都没有吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "It's heavy."
msgstr "很重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "I guess we just... plant it? In the dirt?"
msgstr "我想我们只要……把它种下去？种在土里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "That makes no sense."
msgstr "这完全说不通。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "I wonder what happened to the rest."
msgstr "不知道其余部分怎么了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "What sort of bush is made of marble?"
msgstr "哪种灌木是大理石做的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "I hope it doesn't fall on me."
msgstr "我希望它不会落到我身上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It will be gone soon!"
msgstr "很快就会消失的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "That was over quickly."
msgstr "一下子就结束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks sharp."
msgstr "看起来很锋利。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Those thorns hurt."
msgstr "那些刺好痛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "It's all plant-y."
msgstr "满满的植物感。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's extra dangerous now!"
msgstr "现在更加危险了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "What a pity."
msgstr "真可惜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Not so spiky now, are you?"
msgstr "现在没那么多刺了吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks dangerous."
msgstr "看起来很危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES"
msgid "I do love mashed potatoes."
msgstr "我真的很喜欢土豆泥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT"
msgid "It's a blacksmith mask."
msgstr "这是铁匠面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT"
msgid "It's a cracked doll mask."
msgstr "这是一个破裂的娃娃面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT"
msgid "It's a doll mask."
msgstr "这是娃娃面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT"
msgid "It's was a doll mask at one point."
msgstr "它曾经是一个娃娃面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT"
msgid "It's a fool's mask."
msgstr "这是小丑面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT"
msgid "It's a King mask."
msgstr "这是国王面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT"
msgid "It's a mask, but it looks like a mirror."
msgstr "这是一个面具，但看起来却像一面镜子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT"
msgid "It's a Queen mask."
msgstr "这是女王面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT"
msgid "It's a tree mask."
msgstr "这是一个树面具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST"
msgid "Are we allowed to climb it?"
msgstr "我们可以爬上去吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM"
msgid "I'm full of bright ideas."
msgstr "我满脑子都是亮眼的点子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD"
msgid "It does lighten the mood considerably"
msgstr "它确实让气氛轻松了不少。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD"
msgid "It does lighten the mood considerably"
msgstr "它确实让气氛轻松了不少。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM"
msgid "That's where the lightning goes."
msgstr "闪电就是落到那里去的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM"
msgid "It isn't sailing without a sail."
msgstr "没有帆就不算航海。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS"
msgid "Spread my wings and sail away!"
msgstr "张开翅膀，扬帆远航！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM"
msgid "You can really make a sail out of anything."
msgstr "真是什么东西都能做成帆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD"
msgid "No different from ordinary ones"
msgstr "和普通的没什么区别"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM"
msgid "No different from ordinary ones"
msgstr "和普通的没什么区别"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "He's rather condescending."
msgstr "他相当目中无人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "He sure likes to talk."
msgstr "他确实很喜欢说话。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "These light themselves. How convenient."
msgstr "这些灯会自己亮。真方便。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "It just needs a key."
msgstr "它只需要一把钥匙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "I prefer livelier music."
msgstr "我更喜欢活泼一点的音乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "\"Theocratic Throne\"and it looks sticky."
msgstr "“神权王座”，而且看起来黏糊糊的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "This could be improved with a little cooking."
msgstr "稍微煮一下应该会好吃些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "Meat made into spheres. Neat."
msgstr "把肉做成球状。真整齐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "The rack got dried."
msgstr "架子被烤干了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "It's ready."
msgstr "好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "It's ready."
msgstr "好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "Take your time, meat."
msgstr "慢慢来吧，肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Never mind the rain. Keep drying."
msgstr "别管雨，继续晾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Never mind the rain. Keep drying."
msgstr "别管雨，继续晾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "How long does this take to dry?"
msgstr "这要晾多久才会干？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd like to hang some meat."
msgstr "我想挂些肉上去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT"
msgid "The rack got dried."
msgstr "架子被烤干了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE"
msgid "Excuse me, ma'am, your jerky is ready."
msgstr "打扰了，女士，您的肉干好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "It's ready."
msgstr "好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING"
msgid "Take your time, meat."
msgstr "慢慢来吧，肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Never mind the rain. Keep drying."
msgstr "别管雨，继续晾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Never mind the rain. Keep drying."
msgstr "别管雨，继续晾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "How long does this take to dry?"
msgstr "这要晾多久才会干？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps I'll leave some meat here before I go."
msgstr "也许我走之前可以在这里留点肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD"
msgid "Wait... what are these leaves?"
msgstr "等等……这些叶子是什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Chewy, but satisfying."
msgstr "有嚼劲，但令人满意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE"
msgid "Heh. Shall we cause a little trouble?"
msgstr "呵。我们要不要惹点小麻烦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "It's all swampy."
msgstr "全身都是沼泽味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD"
msgid "I can't tell which way it's looking."
msgstr "我分不清它朝哪个方向看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT"
msgid "Who would want a face like that?"
msgstr "谁会想要那样的脸？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Poor thing."
msgstr "可怜的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's what you get, I suppose."
msgstr "我想这就是下场吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "No one seems to mind."
msgstr "好像没人在意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I doubt anyone would miss this."
msgstr "我怀疑有谁会想念这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "I feel a little bad."
msgstr "我有点过意不去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Is house for fish men!"
msgstr "这是鱼人的家！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "Are you supposed to be important?"
msgstr "您是什么大人物吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "Did I do that? Oh dear."
msgstr "是我干的吗？哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Big sitting mat looks very inviting."
msgstr "大坐垫看起来好舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr "哦不……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "What's all this stuff for?"
msgstr "这些东西是干什么用的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "A royal guard with no Royal to guard."
msgstr "没有王可守的皇家卫队。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "They seem happy to have found a king."
msgstr "他们似乎很高兴找到了一位国王。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "What makes him so special?"
msgstr "他有什么特别的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "A message in a bottle. How romantic."
msgstr "瓶中信。真浪漫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "An old bottle, nothing special."
msgstr "一只旧瓶子，没什么特别。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "I'm sorry about the gym, Wolfgang. It was an accident."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈，健身房的事我很抱歉。那是个意外。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "A fine place for a strongman show."
msgstr "很适合表演大力士的好地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "不，谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "A handy light for our head."
msgstr "照亮头顶的便利灯具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Bring it to fire and hit with hammer."
msgstr "将其放在火上并用锤子敲击。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "The ocean could use a bit more light."
msgstr "海洋需要更多的光线。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "I have to exercise to stay cool. How ironic."
msgstr "为了保持凉爽还得运动。真讽刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "I'll use it carefully."
msgstr "我会小心使用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Ha, who drew that?"
msgstr "哈，这是谁画的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "Looks rather bare."
msgstr "看起来空空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "It's like a sign, but smaller."
msgstr "它就像一个标志，但更小。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "Poor thing. Trapped in this maze."
msgstr "可怜的东西。被困在这个迷宫里了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "Those are impressive horns."
msgstr "真是对了不起的角。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "I wonder if the rings are an indication of age."
msgstr "不知道这些环纹是不是代表年龄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "This robe for miko outfit."
msgstr "这件长袍是巫女装用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA"
msgid "Nagigaga~."
msgstr "薙嘎嘎～。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "Coming up for a peek."
msgstr "冒出来看一眼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "Out of the ground."
msgstr "从地里抓出来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Hiding from the light, huh?"
msgstr "躲着光，是吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT"
msgid "Did it just eat something through its nose?"
msgstr "它刚才是不是用鼻子吃了什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL"
msgid "Is it sleeping in its own snot?"
msgstr "它是睡在自己的鼻涕里吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "Mole skin is stretchy."
msgstr "鼹鼠皮很有弹性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "Mole hole."
msgstr "鼹鼠洞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Joke's on you! I can cut this poo."
msgstr "你可打错算盘了！我连这便便都能砍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "Did you hear something?"
msgstr "你听到什么了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT"
msgid "Well. That explains why nobody invites me into their tree forts."
msgstr "嗯。这就解释了为什么从来没人邀请我去树屋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Nobody ever lets me into their tree forts."
msgstr "从来没人让我进他们的树屋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL"
msgid "Should I be worried about that?"
msgstr "我该担心那个吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS"
msgid "What is all this metal doing here?"
msgstr "这些金属怎么会在这里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR"
msgid "A real pillar of the community."
msgstr "真正的社区支柱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN"
msgid "Being in charge looks easy. I'm sure it isn't."
msgstr "当领袖看起来很轻松。我相信其实并非如此。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "It's so soft. And fuzzy."
msgstr "好软。毛茸茸的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT"
msgid "I took the monkey's hat."
msgstr "我拿走了猴子的帽子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT"
msgid "It rather itches..."
msgstr "还挺痒的……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "不，谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "不，谢谢"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "It's dry and smells strange."
msgstr "又干又有股怪味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "Not for me."
msgstr "我就不用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "A pile of broken rocks."
msgstr "一堆破碎的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's expecting something from me."
msgstr "它在等我给它什么东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "It's doing the opposite of what I hoped."
msgstr "它的作用和我期待的完全相反。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Charging. Please complete soon."
msgstr "充能中。请尽快完成。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "That's obviously wrong."
msgstr "这显然不对。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Please come back!"
msgstr "请回来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "Got you now."
msgstr "抓到你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "They came from a butterfly. Poor thing."
msgstr "这是从蝴蝶身上来的。真可怜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "Just a baby tree."
msgstr "只是棵小树苗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "Doesn't work down here."
msgstr "在这下面不管用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I can still see the moon."
msgstr "我还看得到月亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED"
msgid "I feel like it's staring at me."
msgstr "我感觉它在盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "That's as full as it gets."
msgstr "已经满到头了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "A new moon. A fresh start."
msgstr "新月。一个全新的开始。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon is leaving."
msgstr "月亮在离开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon is waxing, unlike my patience."
msgstr "月亮越来越圆，我的耐心可不是。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "It's very sharp."
msgstr "它非常锋利。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "The moon doesn't like trees."
msgstr "月亮不喜欢树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED"
msgid "I should put this to scientific use before the energy fades!"
msgstr "我得趁能量消散前把它用在科学上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "That's a big chunk of glass."
msgstr "好大一块玻璃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "We should coax them out politely."
msgstr "我们应该有礼貌地把它们请出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "A rock with a hole in it."
msgstr "一块有洞的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "What is this?"
msgstr "这是什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "Just another rock to me."
msgstr "对我来说只是另一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "Neat, it's a ball that floats by itself!"
msgstr "真不错，这球会自己飘浮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "Oh, look. Rocks."
msgstr "哦，看。石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "This den needs clearing."
msgstr "这个巢穴需要清理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC"
msgid "I can see my reflection."
msgstr "我看得到自己的倒影。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED"
msgid "It glows faintly from within."
msgstr "它从内部发出微光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "At least I'll be wearing it in the storm where nobody can see me."
msgstr "至少我是在没人看得见的暴风里戴它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK"
msgid "I'm going to touch it."
msgstr "我要碰一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC"
msgid "Careful, don't get zapped."
msgstr "小心，别被电到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM"
msgid "It crackles."
msgstr "噼啪作响。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Doesn't it feel nice to be back in one piece?"
msgstr "重新完整的感觉很不错吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "Almost done, I promise."
msgstr "快好了，我保证。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL"
msgid "Back together again."
msgstr "又拼回来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "Why do I get the feeling we aren't done yet?"
msgstr "为什么我感觉我们还没有完成？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "This would be easier if you weren't so heavy."
msgstr "要是你没这么重，事情就简单多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "Of course, I'll carry you over."
msgstr "当然，我会把你搬过去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON"
msgid "All right, let's get going."
msgstr "好吧，我们走吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "Okay, let me take you home."
msgstr "好吧，我送你回家吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK"
msgid "Aw come on! What is it?!"
msgstr "拜托！这到底是什么？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "Something inside is calling for me."
msgstr "里面有东西在呼唤我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "Something inside is calling for me."
msgstr "里面有东西在呼唤我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "Something inside is calling for me."
msgstr "里面有东西在呼唤我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "Where do you want to go?"
msgstr "你想去哪里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD"
msgid "You're right. I am the best one to help."
msgstr "你说得对。我确实是最适合帮忙的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP"
msgid "What a weird looking mushroom."
msgstr "多么奇怪的蘑菇啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Once again, cooking makes it better."
msgstr "又一次证明，煮过会更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1"
msgid "Why can't that old gentleman build this himself?"
msgstr "那位老先生为什么不自己建？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2"
msgid "I guess I could just cut it and be done with it, but now I'm rather curious..."
msgstr "我大可以一刀砍了了事，不过现在我还挺好奇的……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC"
msgid "Wonderful. So what does it do?"
msgstr "太好了。那么它能做什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "I think it's whispering to me."
msgstr "我觉得它在对我低语。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "I do not know, maybe we can jam stuff in it."
msgstr "我不知道，也许可以往里面塞东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "Ohh, so that's how she keeps those creeps away."
msgstr "哦，原来她就是这样驱赶那些讨厌鬼的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning!"
msgstr "树着火了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "I don't feel as bad as I thought I would."
msgstr "我的感觉并不像我想象的那么糟糕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It's not going to grow back."
msgstr "它不会再长回来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a pretty tree!"
msgstr "多漂亮的树啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "It fell from the moon tree."
msgstr "它从月亮树上掉下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "What in the world..."
msgstr "这到底是什么……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "It's huge."
msgstr "好大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "It smells strongly of bird."
msgstr "有股浓浓的鸟味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "It looks wonderful."
msgstr "看起来很棒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Trick."
msgstr "诡计。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "How annoying."
msgstr "真烦人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "Please keep that mouth away from me."
msgstr "请把那张嘴离我远一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "Blood must bubble in currents muggy and thick."
msgstr "血液必在闷热而浓稠的潮流中翻涌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Its feathers are frazzled."
msgstr "它的羽毛乱糟糟的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "Sorry, please lend me the funerary items first.."
msgstr "抱歉，请先借我一下陪葬品……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "I think, don't disturb it."
msgstr "我想，还是别打扰它吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "I learned to surf in Hawaii."
msgstr "我在夏威夷学会了冲浪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "It warms you from the inside out."
msgstr "它让你从内到外感到温暖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "It's pretty... pretty scary!"
msgstr "实在是太……太可怕了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "It's made of some kind of rock."
msgstr "它是由某种岩石制成的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "It's very useful."
msgstr "非常有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME"
msgid "It's dropping spores everywhere."
msgstr "它到处掉孢子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "She's going to blow!"
msgstr "她要炸了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "I'd rather not have my head tampered with."
msgstr "我可不想让人动我的脑袋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "How could that not work?"
msgstr "怎么会这样？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "A big, odd mushroom."
msgstr "一朵又大又奇怪的蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "Well, the mold problem is solved."
msgstr "嗯，发霉的问题解决了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "It's just a log."
msgstr "只是一根木头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "They're taking over."
msgstr "它们要占领这里了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "That's rotten. We should clear it out."
msgstr "烂掉了，我们应该清理掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "It can grow in this cold."
msgstr "在这么冷的环境下它也能生长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "There's mushrooms growing in it now."
msgstr "现在里面已经长出了蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "Who needs that many mushrooms?"
msgstr "谁需要那么多蘑菇？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "You must have seen that coming."
msgstr "您一定早就料到了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "This mushroom isn't lighting up."
msgstr "这朵蘑菇亮不起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Not as warm as a fire, but pleasant."
msgstr "没有火那么暖和，但很舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "Now what?"
msgstr "现在怎么办？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "I have a few ideas on how to light it."
msgstr "关于怎么点亮它，我有些想法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "Well, that was a bright idea."
msgstr "嗯，真是个明亮的主意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Don't touch the acid on that tree."
msgstr "别碰到树上的酸液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "It's spreading spores everywhere."
msgstr "它到处散播孢子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "It smells rather strongly."
msgstr "味道相当重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON"
msgid "This mushroom tree is clearly stranger than the rest."
msgstr "这棵蘑菇树显然比其他蘑菇树更奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Don't touch the acid on that tree."
msgstr "别碰到树上的酸液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "I'd rather not get too close."
msgstr "我不太想靠太近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's very mushroomy."
msgstr "蘑菇味很浓。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Don't touch the acid on that tree."
msgstr "别碰到树上的酸液。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "That smell is terrible."
msgstr "那味道太可怕了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "This tree is unwell."
msgstr "这棵树病了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC"
msgid "That one got what it deserves."
msgstr "那一棵算是罪有应得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER"
msgid "Did I mention I'm on good terms with bears?"
msgstr "我说过我和熊的关系很好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
msgid "Er... no hard feelings, right?"
msgstr "呃……别往心里去，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "走得好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "那是什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
msgid "I can see it breathing."
msgstr "我看得到它在呼吸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG"
msgid "Don't worry, you're still going to go down in flames."
msgstr "别担心，你还是会葬身火海的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD"
msgid "Oh, it's dead."
msgstr "哦，它死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Cut IT."
msgstr "砍了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "I don't want to wake it."
msgstr "我不想吵醒它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER"
msgid "There are legs sticking out of it."
msgstr "有几条腿从里面伸出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER"
msgid "There are legs sticking out of it."
msgstr "有几条腿从里面伸出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER"
msgid "This seems to be for spiders to eat."
msgstr "这似乎是给蜘蛛吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON"
msgid "This seems to be for spiders to eat."
msgstr "这似乎是给蜘蛛吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER"
msgid "There are legs sticking out of it."
msgstr "有几条腿从里面伸出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR"
msgid "This seems to be for spiders to eat."
msgstr "这似乎是给蜘蛛吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER"
msgid "This seems to be for spiders to eat."
msgstr "这似乎是给蜘蛛吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Now I'm a fox!."
msgstr "现在我是一只狐狸了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Hentai."
msgstr "变态。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Makes you warm and fuzzy inside. Outside, too."
msgstr "让人从里到外都暖洋洋的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Once the flowers dry, they'll be useful."
msgstr "等花干了就能派上用场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT"
msgid "I've got a nightcap, now where's my candlestick?"
msgstr "睡帽有了，我的烛台在哪里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "It's like fire, but purple."
msgstr "像火一样，不过是紫色的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "It's still warm."
msgstr "它还是温的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH"
msgid "That's probably not... great..."
msgstr "这大概不是……什么好事……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "I wonder what function this served."
msgstr "我想知道这有什么作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE"
msgid "I doubt he'd mind if I had a nibble."
msgstr "我想他不会介意我尝一小口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "Looks normal to me."
msgstr "对我来说看起来很正常。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "I guess it's nearly over."
msgstr "我想事情已经快结束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "I don't think it's working."
msgstr "我认为这不起作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "It's almost humming."
msgstr "它几乎在嗡嗡作响。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "I think it's turning off."
msgstr "我认为它正在关闭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "It's warning me."
msgstr "这是在警告我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "The fuel is coming to life."
msgstr "燃料活过来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "It's electric!"
msgstr "是电动的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "It's like a dream that can hurt real things."
msgstr "就像一场能伤到现实事物的梦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "There are tiny explosions trapped inside."
msgstr "里面困着微小的爆炸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION"
msgid "I don't know how anything could grow in that weird rain."
msgstr "我不明白在那种怪雨里怎么还能长出东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Wow, I always wanted dirt vision... said nobody ever."
msgstr "哇，我一直想要看泥土的视力……才怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OAR"
msgid "Rowing is slower. A sail would be more efficient."
msgstr "划船比较慢。用帆会更有效率。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD"
msgid "Could it be someone else's turn to row?"
msgstr "能换别人来划了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY"
msgid "Perhaps rowing can be fun after all."
msgstr "也许划船也可以很有趣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's a bunch of dirt."
msgstr "一堆泥土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a bunch of water."
msgstr "一大摊水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
msgid "Just a big lump of junk."
msgstr "只是一大团垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL"
msgid "The fish will have a ball with this."
msgstr "鱼一定会玩得很开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY"
msgid "Say y'ello to my little friend!"
msgstr "来跟我的黄色小朋友打个招呼吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW"
msgid "I'd rather eat fish than crow."
msgstr "比起吃乌鸦，我更想吃鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE"
msgid "You're going down, fish!"
msgstr "你要沉下去了，鱼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS"
msgid "Where there's a quill, there's a way."
msgstr "有羽毛的地方就有办法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE"
msgid "A bobber might improve its accuracy."
msgstr "加个浮标也许能更准。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL"
msgid "Those fish won't give me the slip this time!"
msgstr "那些鱼这次不会再让我溜了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN"
msgid "Hopefully it won't attract any red herrings."
msgstr "希望它不会引来误导人的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "The snowbird quill helps me stay frosty."
msgstr "雪鸟的羽毛能让我保持冷静。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY"
msgid "My brain is protected by a thick layer of hard science!"
msgstr "我的大脑有厚厚一层硬科学保护！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY"
msgid "This feels a bit heavy handed."
msgstr "这用起来有点太重了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN"
msgid "Soaking myself might help me think like a fish..."
msgstr "把自己淋湿，也许能学会像鱼一样思考……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW"
msgid "The fish won't snow what hit them!"
msgstr "鱼不会知道是什么击中了它们！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE"
msgid "Some fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "有些鱼可能会觉得这很诱人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN"
msgid "Some fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "有些鱼可能会觉得这很诱人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED"
msgid "Some fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "有些鱼可能会觉得这很诱人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE"
msgid "Some smaller fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "一些较小的鱼可能会觉得这很诱人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN"
msgid "Some smaller fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "一些较小的鱼可能会觉得这很诱人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED"
msgid "Some smaller fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "一些较小的鱼可能会觉得这很诱人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD"
msgid "Now this is the reel deal!"
msgstr "这才是真正的钓竿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1"
msgid "That looks unpleasant."
msgstr "看起来不太舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
msgid "Please stop looking at me like that."
msgstr "请别那样看着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3"
msgid "What's so dandy about it?"
msgstr "这有什么好看的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4"
msgid "I'm not afraid of a little bad luck."
msgstr "我才不怕一点点坏运气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5"
msgid "What... is it?"
msgstr "这……是什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6"
msgid "It's kind of pretty for something that lives in the water."
msgstr "以水里的生物来说，它算是好看的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7"
msgid "It's kind of pretty for something that lives in the water."
msgstr "以水里的生物来说，它算是好看的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8"
msgid "I wouldn't dare lick it."
msgstr "我可不敢舔它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9"
msgid "Another fish for the log."
msgstr "又一条鱼可以记录下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1"
msgid "A small fish specimen."
msgstr "小鱼样本。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2"
msgid "It's so small."
msgstr "好小。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3"
msgid "I thought you would be a bigger fish."
msgstr "我还以为你会是条大鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4"
msgid "Looks more like a shrimp to me."
msgstr "对我来说看起来更像是虾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5"
msgid "Strange..."
msgstr "真奇怪……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6"
msgid "I get the feeling it would burn well."
msgstr "我感觉它应该很好烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7"
msgid "You have something growing on your forehead."
msgstr "你额头上长了东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8"
msgid "Such a pity, a creature that glows living its whole life underwater."
msgstr "真可惜，会发光的生物却一辈子都活在水底。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9"
msgid "Please spit at someone else."
msgstr "请去吐别人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE"
msgid "I think these trees are a little lost."
msgstr "我想这些树有点迷路了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT"
msgid "It's still wet."
msgstr "还是湿的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "Hey, it's going to stop the sun from burning things!"
msgstr "嘿，它能挡住太阳，不让东西晒焦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE"
msgid "A very long vine."
msgstr "一根很长的藤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON"
msgid "It's just dangling up there."
msgstr "就这么吊在上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT"
msgid "That's one way to redecorate."
msgstr "这也算是重新装潢了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL"
msgid "Can't we take the scenic route instead?"
msgstr "我们就不能走风景好的路吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT"
msgid "A decent haul."
msgstr "一个不错的收获。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED"
msgid "You're not supposed to get away!"
msgstr "你不应该逃跑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED"
msgid "That should do it."
msgstr "这样应该行了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "It does the work for me. Wonderful."
msgstr "它替我干活。太好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED"
msgid "I bet it's catching lots of fish right now."
msgstr "我敢说它现在一定捞到很多鱼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT"
msgid "Maybe I can ask one of the others to help build it."
msgstr "也许可以请别人帮忙组装。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "I can play the tune and keep the beat."
msgstr "我既能演奏旋律，又能打节拍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION"
msgid "It's so bulbous."
msgstr "圆鼓鼓的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Roasting is a fine cooking method."
msgstr "烤是个很好的烹饪方式。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I've got to figure out what I'm going to do with all this onion..."
msgstr "我得想想这么多洋葱要怎么办……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "只是一堆种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "It's glittery and mesmerizing."
msgstr "它闪闪发光，令人着迷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Gotta hold it with my sleeve so my hands don't get cold."
msgstr "得隔着袖子拿，手才不会冻到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "It picks up useful materials."
msgstr "它能捡起有用的材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It'll make your fingers tingle."
msgstr "它会让你的手指发麻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "It's a rock."
msgstr "是块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "It gives me a headache."
msgstr "这让我很头疼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "Kind of piney, for a palm tree."
msgstr "以棕榈树来说，它有点像松树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "It has big dreams of being a tree one day."
msgstr "它有一个伟大的梦想：有一天成为一棵树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "If trees had toenails, I imagine they'd look like this."
msgstr "如果树有脚趾甲，我想它们会是这样的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "The very beginnings of a tree."
msgstr "一棵树的起点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "Kind of tacky."
msgstr "有点俗气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "Am I just hungry, or does everything look extra tasty?"
msgstr "我只是饿了，还是所有东西看起来都特别好吃？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Not my preferred style of music."
msgstr "这不是我喜欢的音乐类型。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "Is like paper."
msgstr "就像纸一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "It's so delicate, I almost don't want to eat it. Almost."
msgstr "太精致了，我几乎舍不得吃。几乎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "It has a rather aggressive tail."
msgstr "它的尾巴相当有攻击性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Run away, tiny dancers."
msgstr "快逃吧，小小的舞者们。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Good. These are the spicy ones."
msgstr "很好。这些是辣的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "My mouth is on fire."
msgstr "我的嘴巴着火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "First rule of vegetables: cook them."
msgstr "蔬菜的第一条法则：煮熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That's a lot of heat in one pepper."
msgstr "一颗辣椒里有这么多辣度。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "只是一堆种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Excuse me, those berries aren't for you."
msgstr "打扰了，那些浆果不是给你的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's so big."
msgstr "好大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That won't do at all."
msgstr "那根本不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "The pot's empty."
msgstr "锅已经空了"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I want to give it something!"
msgstr "我想给它点东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "Tasty things."
msgstr "好吃的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Petals. Pretty, but not very useful."
msgstr "花瓣。很漂亮，但不太有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "They're sticky."
msgstr "黏糊糊的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "It's all stone and no bark."
msgstr "全是石头，没有树皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "It's a boogie!"
msgstr "是鼻涕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH"
msgid "Maxwell would probably love this."
msgstr "麦斯威尔大概会很喜欢这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "It's very pointy."
msgstr "很尖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "The plant still serves a purpose as a tool."
msgstr "植物作为工具依然有它的用处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "How does it smell so good?"
msgstr "怎么味道这么好闻？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "已经过气了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "你，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Down you go."
msgstr "给我倒下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "他还真喜欢用那些牌子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "已经过气了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "你，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Down you go."
msgstr "给我倒下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "他还真喜欢用那些牌子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "I like his attitude."
msgstr "我喜欢他的态度。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "A backpack made of pig. Practical."
msgstr "猪皮做的背包。很实用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "It can always get worse, I guess."
msgstr "我想，情况总是会变得更糟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess I have it alright."
msgstr "我想我还算过得不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Well. That's one way to redecorate."
msgstr "嗯。这也算是重新装潢了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "He's doing pig things in there."
msgstr "他在里面做猪会做的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "These pigs have questionable taste in architecture."
msgstr "这些猪的建筑品味值得怀疑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "Hey! Let me in!"
msgstr "嘿！让我进去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "A king with rather loose manners."
msgstr "一位不太讲究礼仪的国王。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "I'd rather not think about it."
msgstr "我不太想去想这件事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "It's following me."
msgstr "它在跟着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "They're rather fragrant."
msgstr "它们的气味相当浓。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "He's not the boss of me."
msgstr "我可不归他管。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Come on, then."
msgstr "来吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt. What a shame."
msgstr "烧掉了。真可惜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Needs meat."
msgstr "需要肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I suppose I don't have a shrine yet."
msgstr "我想我还没有自己的神龛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Pig hide."
msgstr "猪皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "It smells terrible."
msgstr "味道糟透了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "These pigs sure know how to have a good time."
msgstr "这些猪真懂得找乐子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "At last, a helping hand."
msgstr "终于有人帮忙了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "It might be worth something."
msgstr "它也许值点钱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "Hello there, little tree seed."
msgstr "你好呀，小小的树种。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "You'll be a real tree soon."
msgstr "很快你就会成为一棵真正的树。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "Ahoy!"
msgstr "啊嘿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "Treasure. I'm rather good at this."
msgstr "宝藏。我还挺擅长这个的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "Three times the pointiness."
msgstr "尖了三倍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "It's slimy."
msgstr "黏糊糊的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "It smells kind of rotten."
