msgstr "现在这很时尚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
