msgstr "煮一煮总是有帮助。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED"
