#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "It must need a lot of water."
msgstr "它一定需要大量的水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Unpleasant. But useful."
msgstr "不太舒服。但有用。"

