msgstr "便携锅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "All that work for a little bit of spice?"
msgstr "费这么大功夫，就为了一点调料？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "That work had better be worth it."
msgstr "这番功夫最好值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "Nice and sturdy!"
msgstr "又好又坚固！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "I was never any good at setting these things up."
msgstr "我一直不擅长搭这种东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "We grew it in that muck."
msgstr "我们是在那片烂泥里种出来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK"
msgid "A sack of potatoes. Very practical."
msgstr "一袋土豆。非常实用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "Mine never turns out looking like this."
msgstr "我做的从来不会是这个样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "I didn't know potatoes came in that shape."
msgstr "我都不知道土豆还能做成这个形状。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking is mostly patience."
msgstr "烹饪大多靠耐心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED"
