msgstr "它正在小睡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE"
