msgstr "一股黑暗而强大的能量从其中散发而出。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "Double, double toil and... oh. It's burned."
msgstr "双倍、双倍的辛劳，还有……哦。它被烧毁了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "I can use the hat like a cauldron!"
msgstr "我可以把帽子当大锅用！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL"
msgid "Oh yeah, I'm going to have fun with this."
msgstr "哦，这个我可要好好玩一玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "Our policy was canceled."
msgstr "我们的保单被取消了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's our insurance policy."
msgstr "这就是我们的保险单。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "I'll touch it when I'm good and ready."
msgstr "等我准备好了再碰它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "I expected it to be blacker."
msgstr "我还以为它会更黑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL"
msgid "Rhinocebros. Of course."
msgstr "犀牛兄弟。果然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY"
msgid "What an enormous turkey leg!"
msgstr "多么巨大的火鸡腿啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Does that mean winter is gone?"
msgstr "这是否意味着冬天已经过去了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "He likes my pocket."
msgstr "他喜欢我的口袋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Life in the frozen wastes."
msgstr "冰冻荒原里的生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "It's so soft."
msgstr "太软了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Is this really a sewing pattern?"
msgstr "这真的是缝纫图样吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "They're trapped!"
msgstr "他们被困住了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "It's a rock."
msgstr "是块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "What's the point of collecting these again?"
msgstr "再收集这些有什么意义呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC"
msgid "We don't have much in common."
msgstr "我们没什么共同点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN"
msgid "It's not going to grow fruit anymore."
msgstr "它不会再结出果实了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It smells awful."
msgstr "味道太难闻了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "I think it's getting sick."
msgstr "我想它生病了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a fruit bush of some sort."
msgstr "这是某种水果灌木。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Someone took the fruit already."
msgstr "果子已经有人拿走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It's barely even hot out."
msgstr "外面根本没那么热。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT"
msgid "I bet it'll taste good when it's ripe."
msgstr "我敢打赌，当它成熟时，味道一定很好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE"
msgid "It's ripe."
msgstr "熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED"
msgid "It's actually soft enough to eat now."
msgstr "其实现在已经软到可以吃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT"
msgid "It has a little arm."
msgstr "它长了一只小手臂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ice can be useful."
msgstr "冰块很有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "Puddle!"
msgstr "水坑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "Puddle!"
msgstr "水坑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "There's warmth in there, waiting to get out."
msgstr "里面有股暖意，正等着透出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The lava is cooling."
msgstr "熔岩正在冷却。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "暖和又舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "It's cooled off."
msgstr "它凉下来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "Just another rock to me."
msgstr "对我来说只是另一块石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "It's all stone and no bark."
msgstr "全是石头，没有树皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "It's all stone and no bark."
msgstr "全是石头，没有树皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "It's a castle."
msgstr "是座城堡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It has a nasty smile."
msgstr "它笑得真讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "What should we tie up?"
msgstr "我们要绑什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh, why did I smell it?"
msgstr "哦，我为什么要闻它？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "It's very sweet."
msgstr "非常甜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Broken furniture."
msgstr "破损的家具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "It seems like there's something flowing through it."
msgstr "似乎有什么东西在其中流淌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "This will keep the nasties at bay."
msgstr "这能让讨厌的东西不敢靠近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "That could probably be fixed up."
msgstr "这也许修得好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A very very old chest."
msgstr "一个非常非常古老的箱子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "I think it's judging me."
msgstr "我觉得它在评判我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "I'd rather not know what it smells like under the saddle."
msgstr "我不想知道鞍底下是什么味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "It's so uncomfortable."
msgstr "太不舒服了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "Was it worth it? I think it was worth it."
msgstr "值得吗？我认为这是值得的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "I won't be razing any villages, but it looks the part."
msgstr "我不会去烧杀村庄，不过这鞍看起来确实有那个架势。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "Goin' for that understated look, I see."
msgstr "走低调路线，我懂了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "Oh, this is nice."
msgstr "哦，这个不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "It'll keep my stuff from rotting, for a little while."
msgstr "它能让我的东西晚一点腐烂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "It's a big block of slobbery salt."
msgstr "一大块沾满口水的盐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "What a weird rock."
msgstr "多么奇怪的岩石啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "That's... odd."
msgstr "那个……真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "Hey, it's growing back!"
msgstr "嘿嘿，又长出来了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "Someone got all the salt already."
msgstr "有人已经把所有的盐都拿走了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Things are getting gritty!"
msgstr "事情变得很有沙砾感了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Hit and a miss!"
msgstr "时准时不准！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I wonder what these markings mean."
msgstr "我想知道这些标记的含义是什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Where'd it go?"
msgstr "它去哪儿了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "So bright!"
msgstr "好亮啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "Maybe it needs some chicken soup?"
msgstr "也许需要一些鸡汤？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "You smell unwell."
msgstr "你闻起来不太健康。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It'd be worth it to pick that."
msgstr "值得摘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Poor little limp tree."
msgstr "可怜的小树，软趴趴的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "I think the heat broke it."
msgstr "我想是热坏了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "hmmm..?"
msgstr "嗯..？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "It's a burning scarecrow. Poor fellow."
msgstr "一个烧着的稻草人。可怜的家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Just burnt straw."
msgstr "只是烧焦的稻草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "He thinks he's people. Bless him."
msgstr "他以为自己是人。真是的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "That's unpleasant."
msgstr "真不舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Another page for the scrapbook."
msgstr "又一页可以放进剪贴簿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "Roughly made, but it should protect my head."
msgstr "做得粗糙，不过应该能保护头部。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "I'll try looking through it."
msgstr "戴上看看能看见什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "I'm going to carve a stone butt."
msgstr "我要雕一个石头屁股。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I always wanted pottery lessons!"
msgstr "我一直想上陶艺课！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "I guess that's good, too."
msgstr "我想这也不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "A marble statue. Not very lively."
msgstr "一尊大理石雕像。不太有生气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Humpty Dumpty's back together again."
msgstr "矮胖子又拼回来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "It's wriggling."
msgstr "它在扭动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "The crank won't turn."
msgstr "曲柄转不动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "I don't think that was supposed to come off."
msgstr "我想这个本来不该掉下来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It's a marble statue, I guess."
