#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
