msgstr "好吧，来看看这能有多奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT"
