msgstr "我要把这个挂在安全的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
