msgstr "还小小的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "Happy Winter's Feast, everybody."
msgstr "祝大家冬季盛宴快乐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "Are we going to grow a tree?"
msgstr "我们要种棵树吗？"

