msgstr "一块住着龙虾的石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS"
