msgstr "真是只狡猾的龙虾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "You should cook up nicely."
msgstr "你煮了一定很好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
