msgstr "发生了什么？你从树上掉下来了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "Hostile target confirmed. Keep distance."
msgstr "确认为敌对目标。保持距离。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
