msgstr "以猴子来说，你真聪明。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
