msgstr "生日"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.2.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.2.desc"
msgid "Unagi, Bacon and Eggs, Cooked Kelp Fronds, Durian, Roasted durian \nCaliforniaroll, Caviar \nSteamed Ham Sandwich, Tea, Ice Tea \nLiceloaf, Boomberry Pancakes"
msgstr "鳗鱼、培根鸡蛋、熟海带叶、榴莲、烤榴莲 \n加州卷、鱼子酱 \n蒸火腿三明治、茶、冰茶 \n虱子面包、布莓煎饼"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.2.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.2.title"
msgid "Favorite Food"
msgstr "最喜欢的食物"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.3.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.3.desc"
msgid "A strange day and time in the plains, a city far away from the hustle and bustle, a journey to the countryside in the forest, and a shrine to see a shrine. In the shrine village where the shrine is destroyed, a bundle of offering clothing is covered with cloth and clothing. When the curiosity erupted, I touched the handle, and as a result I felt intense pain. When I understood the land, I was shocked and left the place. When they left, a single voice sounded. After the pain disappeared, the eyes turned red and turned red. The shrine has disappeared with no shadow..."
msgstr "平原上陌生的日子和时光，远离喧嚣的城市，森林里的乡村之旅，去看神社的神社。神社被毁的神社村里，一捆祭衣上盖着布衣。当好奇心爆发时，我触碰了手柄，结果我感到剧烈的疼痛。当我了解这片土地时，我大吃一惊，离开了这里。当他们离开时，一道声音响起。疼痛消失后，眼睛变得通红、通红。神社消失得无影无踪……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.3.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.3.title"
msgid "Blood-red pupils"
msgstr "血红之瞳"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.4.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.4.desc"
msgid "Tokijin\nThe cursed sword made from the fangs of the Ghost of God is full of evil, and ordinary people can easily be controlled by it.\nIt was originally broken by Sesshomaru, but Louis found it in an abandoned shrine.. ."
msgstr "斗鬼神\n由鬼的獠牙打造而成的诅咒剑，充满了邪恶，普通人很容易被它控制。\n它原本是被杀生丸破坏的，但露易丝在一座废弃的神社里发现了它……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.4.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.manutsawee.4.title"
msgid "Cursed Sword"
msgstr "诅咒剑"

