#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.inoue.1.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.inoue.1.desc"
msgid "Inoue was brave, just like in the movies: she broke the balance.\n\nOn one mission she killed every target without the organization's approval to save a teammate. To protect itself, the organization put all the blame on her.\n\nWith a bullet in her arm, she fled through the rainy night into an unremarkable alley, where a manhole with no cover opened like an old clock. She jumped in."
msgstr "Inoue 像电影里那样英勇——她打破了不平衡。\n\n某次任务，她为了拯救队友，在没有得到组织的准许下，将组织的目标全部杀死。因无视组织的命令，为了“自保”的组织，将责任全部甩给了 Inoue。\n\n手臂中枪的她在雨夜里逃进一条不起眼的小巷，一个没有井盖的井口像旧钟表一样张开了缝隙——她跳了进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.inoue.1.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.inoue.1.title"
msgid "The Alley"
msgstr "小巷"

